# vvaharness/util/pricing.py

The operator-supplied model price table used to cost a run's token counts. Costing must never fail a scan: a missing or broken table yields null costs.

Source: `vvaharness/util/pricing.py` (lines 1-219)
Executor: code
Called from: `vvaharness/orchestrator/scan.py`, `vvaharness/orchestrator/entry.py` and `vvaharness/manifest.py` (`load_pricing_cached`); `vvaharness/util/stage_telemetry.py` (`bucket_cost_usd`); `vvaharness/util/metrics.py` receives the loaded table

